<title>USA: Town &amp; Country sells Balfour for $52 mln.</title>
<headline>Town &amp; Country sells Balfour for $52 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CHELSEA, Mass. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Town &amp; Country Corp said on Tuesday that it has completed the sale of assets of its L.G. Balfour division to Scholastic Brands Inc for about $52 million.</p>
<p>The company said $14 million of the proceeds will be held in escrow pending the issuance of final approval of the transaction by Federal Trade Commission.</p>
